      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>How to play</b>\n\u2022 Notes fall onto your keys \u2014 play the matching
    key on your real piano as each note reaches the line.\n\u2022 <color=#33CC66>Green</color>
    = correct \xB7 <color=#FF4D4D>Red</color> = wrong note \xB7 <color=#AAAAAA>Grey</color>
    = missed.\n\u2022 Practice waits for the right note and reveals the answer in
    red; Assessment scores you in real time."
